{"unit_id":"tag:0AHF:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个交换图（commutative diagram），由<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）组成。假设<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002><MATH_0004>是满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）的；<STRUCT_0003><MATH_0005>为平坦局部完全交（syntomic）。<STRUCT_0004>\n则<MATH_0006>和<MATH_0007>都为平坦局部完全交（syntomic）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"态射关系，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"图中对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"图中映射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"覆盖条件，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"覆盖条件，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示","context":"覆盖条件，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"syntomic","target_term":"平坦局部完全交","context":"下降的性质，译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0AHF:proof","translation":"由概形（schemes）的对应结果推出此结论。具体地，问题是平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）局部的，在<MATH_0001>和<MATH_0002>上皆然（《空间的态射（Morphisms）》，引理<REF_0001>）。因此，可以假设<MATH_0003>和<MATH_0004>是仿射概形（affine schemes）。由于<MATH_0005>是开的（《空间的态射（Morphisms）》，引理<REF_0002>），可以选择一个仿射概形（affine scheme）<MATH_0006>及一个平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>，使复合（composition）<MATH_0008>是满射（surjective）。在此情形下，结果由《下降（Descent）》引理<REF_0003>得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"归约后的情形，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"局部性方式，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所引章节名称，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"affine schemes","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"归约后的对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"affine scheme","target_term":"仿射概形","context":"辅助对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"辅助映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"辅助映射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"复合映射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"复合映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"所引章节名称，译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
