{"unit_id":"tag:06DQ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一个态射（morphism）。设<MATH_0004>。若<MATH_0005>是平坦的（flat），在<MATH_0006>处，且<MATH_0007>是几何单分支的（geometrically unibranch），在<MATH_0008>处，则<MATH_0009>是几何单分支的（geometrically unibranch），在<MATH_0010>处。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"geometrically unibranch","target_term":"几何单分支的"},{"source_term":"geometrically unibranch","target_term":"几何单分支的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定映射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"指定点处性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"geometrically unibranch","target_term":"几何单分支的","context":"点处下降的性质，译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06DQ:proof","translation":"考虑平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）局部环（local rings）的映射（map）<MATH_0001>。由《空间的态射（Morphisms）》引理<REF_0001>，此映射是平坦的（flat）。因此，若<MATH_0002>具有唯一的最小素理想（minimal prime），则<MATH_0003>也是如此（由下降定理（going down），见《代数（Algebra）》引理<REF_0002>）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的"},{"source_term":"minimal prime","target_term":"最小素理想"},{"source_term":"going down","target_term":"下降定理"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"局部环的类型，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"local rings","target_term":"局部环","context":"点处的环，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"局部环之间的映射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"所引章节名称，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦的","context":"环映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"minimal prime","target_term":"最小素理想","context":"单分支性质的判据，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"going down","target_term":"下降定理","context":"素理想的下降，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"Algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"所引章节名称，译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06MI:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一个态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0004>是平坦（flat）且满射（surjective）的，且<MATH_0005>是约化的（reduced），则<MATH_0006>是约化的（reduced）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化的"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"基对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"给定映射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"下降所沿性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"下降所沿性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"reduced","target_term":"约化的","context":"下降的空间性质，译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06MI:proof","translation":"选择一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>及一个满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>。选择一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>及一个满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>。由于<MATH_0005>是满射（surjective）且平坦（flat）的，概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>是满射（surjective）且平坦（flat）的。这样，问题归结为概形（schemes）的情形（因为<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>的约化性（reducedness）是用<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>的约化性（reducedness）定义的，见《空间的性质》第<REF_0001>节）。概形（schemes）的情形见《下降（Descent）》引理<REF_0002>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"reducedness","target_term":"约化性"},{"source_term":"reducedness","target_term":"约化性"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"呈示对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"呈示及下降映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"第一呈示性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"各呈示映射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"第二呈示性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"下降映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"归约后的对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"reducedness","target_term":"