{"unit_id":"tag:06MJ:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的一个态射（morphism）。若<MATH_0002>是局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）、平坦（flat）且满射（surjective）的，且<MATH_0003>是局部Noether的（locally Noetherian），则<MATH_0004>是局部Noether的（locally Noetherian）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether的"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"态射对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"下降映射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示","context":"下降映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"下降映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"下降映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether的","context":"下降的空间性质，译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06MJ:proof","translation":"选择一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0001>及一个满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>。选择一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0003>及一个满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）态射（morphism）<MATH_0004>。由于<MATH_0005>是满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）的，概形（schemes）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0006>是满射（surjective）、平坦（flat）且局部有限呈示（locally of finite presentation）的。这样，问题归结为概形（schemes）的情形（因为<MATH_0007>和<MATH_0008>局部Noether（locally Noetherian）是用<MATH_0009>和<MATH_0010>局部Noether（locally Noetherian）来定义的，见《空间的性质》第<REF_0001>节）。概形（schemes）的情形下，结果由《下降（Descent）》引理<REF_0002>得出。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"locally of finite presentation","target_term":"局部有限呈示"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether"},{"source_term":"locally Noetherian","target_term":"局部Noether"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"呈示对象，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"呈示及下降映射性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"第一呈示性质，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","contex